    "names": [
      "code survives its own closing-fence characters and untrusted metadata cannot escape the block",
      "ordinary code languages register through native hooks and leave specialized renderers available",
      "a conflicting registration releases every earlier claim",
      "extension registers with the original host and creates no replacement engine or transport",
      "grading observations cannot change review before native answer acceptance",
      "forged text, raw tool results and incorrect occurrence bindings cannot create progress",
      "open responses are assessed by ordinary teacher continuation against the accepted answer",
      "first-pass completion permits mistakes and preserves their independent review queue",
      "a copied immediate answer does not clear a recent mistake before retrieval delay",
      "correct first-pass questions cannot clear a mistake before the missed concept returns",
      "lesson settings reopen coverage when newly selected formats have not been attempted",
      "native plan IDs and selected question types remain authoritative",
      "canonical reconciliation is idempotent and survives plugin restart without regrading",
      "single-step lessons can share a coarse native plan node without sharing coverage or mastery",
      "contributed choices are validated, snapshotted and retained when their plugin is disabled",
      "an already posed contributed quiz survives deselection and uses its committed reference for ordinary teacher feedback",
      "native confidence is saved, backfilled from accepted evidence and retained through restart without regrading",
      "a hesitant correct answer suggests one delayed reinforcement without becoming a mistake",
      "confident mistakes lead due reviews without being erased by correct first-pass answers",
      "missing, invalid and declined confidence never becomes an invented learning signal",
      "visible correction reads the accepted committed answer without regrading or clearing review"
    ]
  },
